# Copy to .env and edit. docker compose reads .env automatically, so with this in place
# bringing the stand up is `docker compose up -d --build` again.
#
# The addresses live here rather than in the binary on purpose. One compiled into the
# service needs a rebuild and a redeploy to correct, and a two-entry map of chains reads
# as a claim that those are the only chains it runs on — which is false, since devnets are
# the case it is pointed at most often.

# Execution endpoints, comma separated. Whatever chain these are on, CHAIN_ID and
# LIDO_LOCATOR have to agree with it: the chain id is checked against the node, and the
# store lives in a schema named after it.
PROVIDERS_URLS=

# ---- mainnet ----
# CHAIN_ID=1
# LIDO_LOCATOR=0xC1d0b3DE6792Bf6b4b37EccdcC24e45978Cfd2Eb

# ---- hoodi ----
# CHAIN_ID=560048
# LIDO_LOCATOR=0xe2EF9536DAAAEBFf5b1c130957AB3E80056b06D8

# ---- a devnet ----
# Its own chain id and its own locator, both from whoever deployed it. This is the case
# the compiled-in map could not serve at all.
# CHAIN_ID=
# LIDO_LOCATOR=

# The Locator is the one address everything else is resolved from — the staking router,
# and through it every module. The deployed-contracts page at docs.lido.fi is the
# reference for the public networks; anything else comes from its own deployment.

# Optional. Defaults are in cmd/keys-api/main.go.
# UPDATE_KEYS_INTERVAL_MS=12000
# RETAIN_VERSIONS=20
# Concurrent key dumps and diffs; the rest answer 503 after a 10 s wait. Must stay below
# DATABASE_MAX_CONNS (default: half of it), so probes, /v1/status and the writer keep a connection.
# STREAM_MAX_CONCURRENT=5
# A single dump or diff is cut after this long.
# STREAM_MAX_DURATION_MS=600000
# Which version each surface serves when a request does not pin one. Leave KEYS_API_PIN
# on latest: /v1 and /v2 exist to be indistinguishable from the canonical service, and
# that service reads the registry at the head. KEYS_API_EXT_PIN is /ext/v1 only, where
# ?snapshot= works and a consumer can ask for the head when it wants it.
# KEYS_API_PIN=latest
# KEYS_API_EXT_PIN=finalized
# PROVIDER_JSON_RPC_MAX_BATCH_SIZE=40
# PROVIDER_CONCURRENT_REQUESTS=6
# LOG_LEVEL=info

# The fork suite (make test-fork). An archive node, because the scenarios read state at a
# block well behind head.
# FORK_UPSTREAM_RPC=
# FORK_BLOCK=3290000
